    }, {
      "name" : "Register to last frame of channel 0",
      "description" : "<html>\n  <head>\n\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <p>\n      Only calculate the alignment for channel 0, with the last frame as \n      reference. For all other Z/C/T slices apply the same transformation.\n    </p>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
