      "name" : "Register to last frame of reference",
      "description" : "<html>\n  <head>\n    \n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <p>\n      Each slice is registered to its equivalent Z/C position in the \n      reference. Always use the last frame of the reference.\n    </p>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
